  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-bffe03609f@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>For the first time, Stryker was named one of Europe’s Best Workplaces, ranking #14 out of 25 companies on the Great Place to Work (GPTW) list. Stryker qualified in the category of the Best Multinational Workplaces in Europe because of its GPTW awards received in late 2018/2019, including France, Italy, Spain and the UK. Employees’ responses on the Trust Index Survey is the primary deciding factor in GPTW’s ranking.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.greatplacetowork.com/best-workplaces-international/europe-s-best-workplaces/2019\">Read the full article</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
